# D3-SU-004: Sacrificial protection has a finite inventory
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
add v1 Fe 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 0.00005mol
seal v1 500mL
add v1 O2 0.003mol
wait 48h
inspect
wait 192h
look v1
particles v1
inspect
